  (descr "Kycon KPJX-4S-S 4-pin power DIN jack, right angle, through hole. From Kycon drawing KPJX-4S-S rev A17 recommended PCB layout (bottom view, mirrored here to top view). Body 16 x 15 x 13.4 mm, front face at y=-3.5: put it on the board edge. The Ø12.9 barrel protrudes 4.0 mm past it (to y=-7.5) through the panel. Kycon pin numbers; with a Mean Well R7B plug, pads 2/4 = +V and 1/3 = -V (Mean Well numbers its plug differently). Pad 5 = shield.")
